WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.817
"Oh, Rat," Mole cried.

2
00:00:06.818 --> 00:00:09.836
"I've been so scared!"

3
00:00:09.837 --> 00:00:12.592
Mole was shivering and tired.

4
00:00:12.593 --> 00:00:15.187
Rat patted him.

5
00:00:15.188 --> 00:00:19.408
"I tried to warn you, Mole," said Rat.

6
00:00:19.409 --> 00:00:24.200
"We Riverbankers never come here by ourselves."

7
00:00:24.201 --> 00:00:27.481
"I'm sorry, Rat," cried Mole.

8
00:00:27.482 --> 00:00:31.528
"It can be a dangerous place," said Rat.

9
00:00:31.529 --> 00:00:35.393
"There are tricks for hiking in the Wild Wood."

10
00:00:35.394 --> 00:00:38.486
"Tricks?" said Mole.

11
00:00:38.487 --> 00:00:41.321
"You need to know certain words.

12
00:00:41.322 --> 00:00:44.298
You need special plants to carry.

13
00:00:44.299 --> 00:00:47.579
You need to know the sounds in the wood.

14
00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:51.829
It's easy if you know these things," said Rat.

15
00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:57.413
"If you don't, you can get into big trouble."

16
00:00:57.414 --> 00:01:03.378
"I bet Toad comes here by himself," said Mole.

17
00:01:03.379 --> 00:01:06.786
"Old Toad?" Rat laughed.

18
00:01:06.787 --> 00:01:10.262
"He wouldn't come here for a bag of gold!"

19
00:01:10.263 --> 00:01:13.802
Mole was cheered by Rat's laugh.

20
00:01:13.803 --> 00:01:15.884
"Come on, then," said Rat.

21
00:01:15.885 --> 00:01:18.045
"It's time to go home.

22
00:01:18.046 --> 00:01:19.946
We can't stay here at night.

23
00:01:19.947 --> 00:01:21.557
It's too cold."

24
00:01:21.558 --> 00:01:25.411
Rat poked his head out of the hollow tree.

25
00:01:25.412 --> 00:01:29.453
"Oh no," said Rat.

26
00:01:29.454 --> 00:01:32.293
"What's up, Ratty?" asked Mole.

27
00:01:32.294 --> 00:01:35.347
"Snow is up," replied Rat.

28
00:01:35.348 --> 00:01:37.180
"I mean down.

29
00:01:37.181 --> 00:01:40.921
Snow is falling everywhere."

30
00:01:40.922 --> 00:01:43.792
Mole looked out of the hollow.

31
00:01:43.793 --> 00:01:47.390
The forest was covered in white.

32
00:01:47.391 --> 00:01:52.053
Big white snowflakes filled the air.

33
00:01:52.054 --> 00:01:57.236
"It's beautiful," said Mole.

34
00:01:57.237 --> 00:02:01.789
"Yes, you're right," said Rat, sounding worried.

35
00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:05.047
"The snow makes everything look different."

36
00:02:05.048 --> 00:02:08.217
"What's the matter?" asked Mole.

37
00:02:08.218 --> 00:02:14.976
"Now even I can't tell where we are!" said Rat.

